e\n• Communicating discreetly in meetings, classes, or public spaces\n• People with hearing or visual impairments\n• Anyone who wants a completely private, off-screen conversation\nHOW IT WORKS:\n• Short tap = dot (·)\n• Long press = dash (—)\n• Swipe up to send immediately\n• Wait a few seconds and the message sends automatically\n• Swipe down to unsend your last message\n• Two fingers to exit dark mode\nDARK SCREEN MODE:\nEnter a pitch-black interface where your phone becomes a silent communication device. Feel incoming messages as morse vibration patterns. Reply by tapping directly on the screen.\nFEATURES:\n• Real-time Morse code messaging\n• Haptic vibration receive mode — feel what your contact is saying\n• Text receive mode — read decoded messages on screen\n• Auto-send after configurable silence period\n• Friend request system — approve who can message you\n• Group messaging support\n• Global dark mode — receive from any friend at once\n• Block and report users who violate community guidelines\n• Remove ads with a one-time purchase\nSilent Morse works over any internet connection. Messages are delivered instantly through secure Firebase infrastructure. Conversations are automatically pruned to keep things lightweight.\nSafe & respectful messaging — by using Silent Morse you agree to our Terms of Service and content guidelines.\nStart communicating in silence.", "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "Silent Morse", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/silent-morse/id6760956001?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "17+", "userRatingCount": 0}]}